WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.998
A broken link.

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:02.218
A missing child.

00:00:02.438 --> 00:00:03.994
One unexpected chance.

00:00:04.214 --> 00:00:06.351
Someone opens a page that isn't there...

00:00:06.815 --> 00:00:08.719
and sees a face they won't forget.

00:00:09.265 --> 00:00:11.157
Later, a moment of recognition.

00:00:11.413 --> 00:00:12.620
A call to the police.

00:00:12.748 --> 00:00:15.058
And the possibility of a child coming home.

00:00:15.604 --> 00:00:19.969
With 404 Missing, your website can show official missing-child appeals.

00:00:20.376 --> 00:00:22.222
Turn dead links into lifelines.

00:00:22.477 --> 00:00:24.729
Find the open-source project on GitHub.

00:00:25.031 --> 00:00:26.030
Scan the code.

00:00:26.332 --> 00:00:27.678
Add it to your site.
